    "head_commit_message": "docs(decisions): Decision 148 and spec 36, open questions as GitHub issues\n\nAnswers Q30. Open questions become issues labelled `question`; a PR names\nits spec as a milestone and its step as a `step:<id>` label. Decisions,\nspecs, their steps and hand-offs stay in the repo. A hand-run github-sync\nworkflow makes labels and milestones and migrates the entries (spec 36\nstep 1); step 2 turns OPEN_QUESTIONS.md into a pointer and updates the\nskills. The Project is the owner's.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Eyaj4hM8LH2xL4Hia549XW",
